OL,3,GNEWSAPolice seek dog after series of
OL,4,Asheep deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are searching for the owner of a
OL,7,Fdistinctive dog believed to have been
OL,8,Finvolved in a series of fatal sheep
OL,9,Fattacks in Devon.
OL,11,FDevon and Cornwall Police has launched
OL,12,Fan investigation into nine reports of
OL,13,Fsheep worrying and attacks at farms
OL,14,Fwith a "blue merle collie type dog"
OL,15,Fhaving been sighted in affected areas.
OL,17,FWith at least 35 sheep killed and
OL,18,F"dozens more" suffering serious
OL,19,Finjuries, the spate of incidents had
OL,20,Fbeen "extremely distressing" for
OL,21,Ffarmers, said PC Lucy Wyatt, rural
OL,22,Faffairs officer.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
