OL,3,GNEWSAPolice seek dog after series of
OL,4,Asheep deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe added: "We appreciate that the
OL,7,Fowner may be completely unaware that
OL,8,Ftheir dog is leaving home during the
OL,9,Fevening or overnight, and we are keen
OL,10,Fto identify them as soon as possible."
